    [3511]={name="Cloak of the People's Militia",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Red Leather Bandanas” — pick it over the other choices. In Westfall.",zone="Westfall",questName="Red Leather Bandanas",lore="The Defias Front is constantly shifting. I've been following their movements for quite some time now. On a side note, I've ascertained that many members of the gang can be tracked by the Red Leather Bandanas they wear."},
    [3570]={name="Bonegrinding Pestle",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Arugal's Folly” — pick it over the other choices. In Silverpine Forest.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="Arugal's Folly",lore="As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool. I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy."},
    [3572]={name="Daryl's Shortsword",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “A Hunter's Challenge”. In Loch Modan.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="A Hunter's Challenge",lore="ath, is it? I can tell you're bursting with pride over completing the first test, hm? As I told you before, it's no large feat. You should try your hand at boar hunting."},
    [3578]={name="Harvester's Pants",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Killing Fields” — pick it over the other choices. In Westfall.",zone="Westfall",questName="The Killing Fields",lore="Look at what has happened to this place! These lands were once occupied by good farm folk. But the damned thieves have driven them all off. Not me, though!"},
    [3581]={name="Serrated Knife",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Wand to Bethor” — pick it over the other choices. In Silverpine Forest.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="Wand to Bethor",lore="Thule once told me that, long ago, he and two colleagues created a magic wand, woven together from the apprentice wands each mage possessed."},
    [3741]={name="Stomping Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Elixir of Pain” — pick it over the other choices. In Hillsbrad Foothills.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Elixir of Pain",lore="Oh...the flowers are blooming in Hillsbrad and the air is so fresh and brisk. I can't help but to wallow in the misery of it all. I look out my grimy window and long for the day when our New Plague brings this world the death it deserves."},
    [3848]={name="Big Bronze Knife",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
