    [4906]={name="Rainwalker Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Rite of Vision” — pick it over the other choices. In Mulgore.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Rite of Vision",lore="I now present you with the Water of the Seers. When you are ready, consume the waters near the tribal fire. Once you have ingested the holy waters, it will take a few moments before the vision materializes before the fire."},
    [4907]={name="Woodland Tunic",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Webwood Egg” — pick it over the other choices. In Shadowglen.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="Webwood Egg",lore="Now that I have the spiders' venom, I'd like some live specimens to study. Unfortunately, capturing a living, giant spider is more than I can ask of you, young."},
    [4908]={name="Nomadic Bracers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Hunt Continues” — pick it over the other choices. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Continues",lore="A tauren skilled in the ways of the hunt knows that his prey is not for mere trophy. The beasts of the plains provide us with a means of survival."},
    [4909]={name="Kodo Hunter's Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Rites of the Earthmother”. In Mulgore.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Rites of the Earthmother",lore="We are hunters. Down below in Mulgore there is a mighty kodo named Arra'chea."},
    [4914]={name="Battleworn Leather Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Cutting Teeth” — pick it over the other choices. In Valley of Trials.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Cutting Teeth",lore="The first order of business will be to put a little strength in your backbone. I could send you out to the Barrens to hunt kodo, but well, in all honesty, you're more useful to us alive than dead."},
    [4921]={name="Dust-covered Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Burning Blade Medallion” — pick it over the other choices. In Valley of Trials.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Burning Blade Medallion",lore="Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."},
    [4928]={name="Sandrunner Wristguards",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “From The Wreckage....” — pick it over the other choices. In Durotar.",zone="Durotar",questName="From The Wreckage....",lore="One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."},
    [4942]={name="Tiger Hide Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Dark Storms”. In Durotar.",zone="Durotar",questName="Dark Storms",lore="We cannot allow the Burning Blade a foothold in Durotar! We must destroy them before their evil festers!"},
    [4947]={name="Jagged Dagger",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Skull Rock” — pick it over the other choices. In Durotar.",zone="Durotar",questName="Skull Rock",lore=". The Burning Blade has infested the cave east of Orgrimmar known as Skull Rock. Inside that cave they perform vile rituals, and burn their own flesh with Searing Collars."},
    [4951]={name="Squealer's Belt",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from \"Squealer\" Thornmantle in Kalimdor.",zone="Kalimdor",npc="\"Squealer\" Thornmantle"},
    [4954]={name="Nomadic Belt",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Hunt Begins” — pick it over the other choices. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Begins",lore="You have a promising air about you, and will prove yourself to the tribe. Perhaps someday soon you will be welcomed into the great city of Thunder Bluff."},
    [4962]={name="Double-layered Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Gathering Leather” — pick it over the other choices. In Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Gathering Leather",lore="Greetings, young one. You have a gleam in your eye; I can tell you are eager to venture back to the plains for the hunt. May you bring honor to your clan!"},
    [4971]={name="Skorn's Hammer",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Demon Scarred Cloak” — pick it over the other choices. In Mulgore.",zone="Mulgore",questName="The Demon Scarred Cloak",lore="The ragged hide of Ghost Howl still bears a terrible wound, gained from the wolf's battles against the Burning Legion. Perhaps someone in Bloodhoof Village should know of Ghost Howl's demise...."},
    [5112]={name="Ritual Blade",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Rathorian (rare spawn) in Kalimdor.",zone="Kalimdor",npc="Rathorian"},
    [5192]={name="Thief's Blade",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Mr. Smite in The Deadmines.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Mr. Smite"},
    [5193]={name="Cape of the Brotherhood",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Edwin VanCleef in The Deadmines.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Edwin VanCleef"},
    [5254]={name="Rugged Spaulders",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Rethilgore in Shadowfang Keep.",zone="Shadowfang Keep",npc="Rethilgore"},
    [5257]={name="Dark Hooded Cape",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Nimar the Slayer (rare spawn) in Eastern Kingdoms.",zone="Eastern Kingdoms",npc="Nimar the Slayer"},
    [5279]={name="Harpy Skinner",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Serena Bloodfeather” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Serena Bloodfeather",lore="You did so well with the lieutenants and underlings that I'd like you to do one last thing for me. Serena Bloodfeather is the sister of a harpy named Bloodfeather who was slain by Rexxar quite a while ago."},
    [5299]={name="Gloves of the Moon",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Cry of the Thunderhawk”. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Cry of the Thunderhawk",lore="The thunderhawk, is a fierce beast. It is time for you to face them. You must find where it roams, and bring me its wings as proof of your successful hunt."},
    [5314]={name="Boar Hunter's Cape",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Consumed by Hatred” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Consumed by Hatred",lore="Perhaps you know the pain of uncertainty, perhaps not. But know this: I stand here every day, from the sun's rising till its decline, scouring the horizon for more of those monsters."},
    [5319]={name="Bashing Pauldrons",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Haren Swifthoof in The Loch.",zone="The Loch",npc="Haren Swifthoof"},
    [5327]={name="Greasy Tinker's Pants",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Escape” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Escape",lore="I suppose I'll learn as we go... Couldn't be too hard. Just some buttons here, and a lever or two... Well, are you ready to go?"},
    [5346]={name="Orcish Battle Bow",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Centaur Bracers” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5351]={name="Bounty Hunter's Ring",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Hezrul Bloodmark”. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Hezrul Bloodmark",lore="Hezrul Bloodmark is the leader of the Kolkar centaurs in the Barrens. He is fierce, brutal and cunning. Defeating him would disrupt and fracture the Kolkars, greatly reducing their threat to us."},
    [5394]={name="Archery Training Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Balance of Nature” — pick it over the other choices. In Shadowglen.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="The Balance of Nature",lore="Greetings. I am Conservator Ilthalaine. My purpose in Shadowglen is to ensure that the balance of nature is maintained."},
    [5404]={name="Serpent's Shoulders",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lady Anacondra in Wailing Caverns.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Lady Anacondra"},
    [5591]={name="Rain-spotted Cape",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Enchanted Glade” — pick it over the other choices. In Teldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Enchanted Glade",lore="I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."},
    [5596]={name="Ashwood Bow",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Crown of the Earth” — pick it over the other choices. In Teldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Crown of the Earth",lore="Without the blessings of Alexstrasza the Life-Binder and Nozdormu the Timeless, Teldrassil's growth has not been without flaw."},
    [5616]={name="Gutwrencher",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 15 creature types around level 44-46. Also found on the auction house.",proc="Chance on hit: Wounds the target causing them to bleed for 80 damage over 30 sec."},
    [5617]={name="Vagabond Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Bashal'Aran” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Bashal'Aran",lore="It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."},
    [5627]={name="Relic Blade",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Absent Minded Prospector” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil. While I traveled on the road to meet Whelgar, I was attacked by raptors and the relic was lost."},
    [5629]={name="Hammerfist Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Absent Minded Prospector” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus? I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."},
