    [6691]={name="Swinetusk Shank",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Agathelos the Raging in Razorfen Kraul.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Agathelos the Raging"},
    [6696]={name="Nightstalker Bow",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Blind Hunter in Razorfen Kraul.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Blind Hunter"},
    [6719]={name="Windborne Belt",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Highperch Venom”. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Highperch Venom",lore="As you may know, wyverns are often tamed by orcs for use as mounts. But what is less known is that the venom of a wyvern, in some circles, is more valuable than the beast itself."},
    [6720]={name="Spirit Hunter Headdress",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Frostmaw”. In Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Frostmaw",lore="it is now time for you to travel to far-off lands. You are ready. You now hunt Frostmaw, a yeti in the Alterac Mountains. He is elusive, his white coat blending into the snows of his mountain home."},
    [6723]={name="Medal of Courage",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Saving Yenniku” — pick it over the other choices. In Stranglethorn Vale.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Saving Yenniku",lore="I have reshaped the Mind's Eye into a Soul Gem. Its purpose is twofold: you must use it to stun Yenniku, and once stunned place it upon his head to entrap his soul."},
    [6748]={name="Monkey Ring",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Willix the Importer” — pick it over the other choices. In Razorfen Kraul.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Willix the Importer",lore="At last, help has arrived! You have no clue how long I've been held prisoner here. I can't remember the last time I saw the outside of this place."},
    [6752]={name="Lancer Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Mortality Wanes” — pick it over the other choices. In Razorfen Kraul.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Mortality Wanes",lore="I have not long to live... so... so... weak....the b-b-brave dwarf, Lonebrow, has been sent to w-w-warn Falfindel... But before I... d-d-die......my wife, Treshala..."},
    [6804]={name="Windstorm Hammer",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Final Passage” — pick it over the other choices. In Thousand Needles.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Final Passage",lore="You have done well. You have passed my test, and the tests before mine. Return to Dorn in Thousand Needles."},
    [6831]={name="Black Menace",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “In the Name of the Light” — pick it over the other choices. In Scarlet Monastery.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead.",proc="Chance on hit: Sends a shadowy bolt at the enemy causing 30 Shadow damage."},
    [6902]={name="Bands of Serra'kis",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Old Serra'kis in Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Old Serra'kis",lore="Serra'kis is the great water beast the naga breed in the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps, and the reason the lower temple is under water at all."},
